@startuml sd-03-share-link
' Owner: Prithvi | SAD 4.2 | SD-03 Join via share link and revocation
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 140
skinparam ParticipantPadding 2
skinparam BoxPadding 2
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F5F8FC
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #3B5B85
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
hide footbox
title SD-03 (part 1) — guest resolves a share link

participant "Guest\nclient\n(COMP-01/02)" as GC
participant "REST API\n(COMP-03)" as REST
participant "Board &\nAccess\n(COMP-05)" as AC
participant "Auth\nService\n(COMP-04)" as AUTH
participant "Persist-\nence\n(COMP-08)" as DB
participant "Real-time\nServer\n(COMP-06)" as RT
participant "Owner\nclient" as OC

== Resolve link (FR-046, SEC-REQ-004) ==
note over GC : Guest opens https://<host>/join#<token>\nand enters the display name "Asha"
GC -> REST : POST /api/v1/links/resolve {token, displayName:"Asha"}
REST -> AC : resolveLink(token)
AC -> DB : find shareLink by SHA-256(token)
DB --> AC : {linkId, boardId, role:"editor", expiresAt, revokedAt:null}

newpage SD-03 (part 2) — valid link: guest token issued

== [alt 1] link valid (not expired, not revoked) ==
AC -> AUTH : issueGuestToken(boardId, linkId, role,\n exp = min(expiresAt, now + 24 h))
AUTH --> AC : guest JWT
AC --> REST : {boardId, role, guestToken}
REST --> GC : 200 {boardId, role:"editor", guestToken}

newpage SD-03 (part 3) — guest joins the board

== [alt 1, continued] join the board room (FR-024, SEC-REQ-002) ==
GC -> RT : connect (handshake auth: guestToken)
RT -> AUTH : verifyToken(guestToken)
AUTH --> RT : guest, boardId, linkId, role
GC -> RT : board:join {boardId}
RT -> AC : authorize(guest, boardId, "view") (re-checks link)
AC --> RT : allowed
RT --> GC : ack {ok, role, state:{seq, objects[]}, participants[]}
RT -> RT : broadcast presence:update to room

newpage SD-03 (part 4) — expired, revoked or unknown link

== [alt 2] link expired or revoked (FR-048) ==
AC --> REST : LINK_EXPIRED or LINK_REVOKED
REST --> GC : 410 {error:{code:"LINK_EXPIRED" or "LINK_REVOKED"}}

== [alt 3] unknown token ==
AC --> REST : LINK_NOT_FOUND
REST --> GC : 404 {error:{code:"LINK_NOT_FOUND"}}

newpage SD-03 (part 5) — Owner revokes the link

== Later: Owner revokes the link (FR-047) ==
OC -> REST : DELETE /api/v1/boards/{boardId}/links/{linkId}\nAuthorization: Bearer <session token>
REST -> AC : authorize(owner, boardId, "manageLinks"); revoke
AC -> DB : set revokedAt = now
AC -> RT : linkRevoked(boardId, linkId)
RT -> GC : access:revoked {reason:"LINK_REVOKED"}
RT -> GC : disconnect (within 5 s)
RT -> RT : presence:update to remaining participants
REST --> OC : 204 No Content
note right of REST : Security event link.revoked logged.\nRegistered members admitted by the link keep\ntheir membership (FR-047).
@enduml
